    { name: "High-Flow Turbo Inlet", description: "Enlarged cast aluminum intake pipe removing the restrictive factory plastic baffles.", benefit: "Increases airflow to the compressor wheel, noticeably reducing ICE spool time and enhancing throttle response when the battery is depleted." }
